for the purchasers specific use or intended application.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSodium selenate decahydrate (CAS 10102-23-5) | ספק בישראל · LABO (https://www.labo.co.il/product-GB61136.html)\nciteturn46search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Sodium selenate decahydrate (catalogue number GB61136) is a research-grade chemical available from LABO Scientific in Israel, CAS registry number 10102-23-5.\n\nHome› Catalogue› Small Molecules› GB61136\n\nImage: Chemical structure of Sodium selenate decahydrate\n\nGB61136\n\n# Sodium selenate decahydrate\n\nAlso known as disodium;selenate;decahydrate\n\nSodium selenate decahydrate (catalogue number GB61136) is a research-grade chemical available from LABO Scientific in Israel, CAS registry number 10102-23-5. Molecular formula H20Na2O14Se, molecular weight 369.09. IUPAC name: disodium;selenate;decahydrate. Supplied in 2 pack sizes, from 25g at ₪784.11 to 100g at ₪1,282.51; the final price is confirmed on your quote, and the lot certificate of analysis and safety data sheet are emailed with your order confirmation.\n\nChemical CAS 10102-23-5 MW369.09 FormulaH_{20}Na_{2}O_{14}Se\n\n₪784.11 25g\n\nEstimated · final price confirmed on your quote\n\nPack size\n\n25g₪784.11\n\n100g₪1,282.51\n\nAvailable to orderShips to your lab in Israel in 8–14 business days\n\nAdd to Quote\n\nAsk about this item on WhatsApp\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSodium selenate decahydrate, 99.9% (metals basis) 100 g | Buy Online | Thermo Scientific Chemicals | Fisher Scientific (https://www.fishersci.com/shop/products/sodium-selenate-decahydrate-99-9-metals-basis-thermo-scientific/AA1423922)\nciteturn46search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Image: Sodium selenate decahydrate, 99.9% (metals basis) 100 g | Buy Online | Thermo Scientific Chemicals | Fisher Scientific Sodium selenate decahydrate, 99.9% (metals basis) Catalog No.: AA1423922 ... CAS: 10102-23-5 ∣ H20Na2O14Se ∣ 369.10 g/mol ... Synonym  | sodium selenate decahydrate, unii-0cjn4029eb, disodium decahydrate selenate, disodium selenate decahydrate, acmc-1c452, sodium selenate decahydrate, technical grade, selenic acid, disodiumsalt, decahydrate 9ci, sodium selenate decahydrate trace metals basis Show More\n\nCAS: 10102-23-5 ∣ H20Na2O14Se ∣ 369.10 g/mol\n\nSodium selenate decahydrate is used as a feed additive, as a mineral supplement, as analytical reagents and in horticultural applications. Further, it is used in manufacturing of glass to counter the color caused by iron impurities. It is also employed in the prevention of abnormal tissue growth. In addition to this, it is used as a micronutrient which prevents a deficiency of copper, manganese and selenium.\n\nThis Thermo Scientific Chemicals brand product was originally part of the Alfa Aesar product portfolio. Some documentation and label information may refer to the legacy brand. The original Alfa Aesar product / item code or SKU reference has not changed as a part of the brand transition to Thermo Scientific Chemicals.\n\n### Chemical Identifiers\n\nCAS  | 10102-23-5\nMolecular Formula  | H20Na2O14Se\nMolecular Weight (g/mol)  | 369.10\nMDL Number  | MFCD00149174\nInChI Key  | TYVNFQRMDPFYPC-UHFFFAOYSA-L\nSynonym  | sodium selenate decahydrate, unii-0cjn4029eb, disodium decahydrate selenate, disodium selenate decahydrate, acmc-1c452, sodium selenate decahydrate, technical grade, selenic acid, disodiumsalt, decahydrate 9ci, sodium selenate decahydrate trace metals basis Show More\nPubChem CID  | 202320\nIUPAC Name  | disodium;selenate;decahydrate\nSMILES  | O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.O.[Na+].[Na+].[O-][Se]([O-])(=O)=O Show More\n\n### Specifications\n\nMelting Point  | 35°C (decomposition)\nPhysical Form  | Crystalline\nQuantity  | 100 g\nAssay Percent Range  | 99.9% (metals basis)\nDensity  | 1.600 g/mL\nUN Number  | UN2630\nMerck Index  | 14,8671\nSolubility Information  | Soluble in water